cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Public procurement open data: Portugal and Europe, 2026"
message: "If you use these data, please cite them as below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "TRINTA"
    website: "https://trinta.ai"
abstract: >-
  Measured public procurement data for 2026: contracts, value and competition
  for every CPV code used in Portugal (171,806 contracts from the Portal BASE,
  IMPIC, January to August), Portuguese public buyers and their share of direct
  awards, and the share of lots drawing a single bid in the EU Official Journal
  (TED) by country and CPV division and in the UK Find a Tender Service
  (January to July).
version: "2026.08"
date-released: "2026-10-11"
url: "https://trinta.ai/barometro"
repository-code: "https://github.com/trinta-ai/public-procurement-data"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - public procurement
  - contratação pública
  - public tenders
  - concursos públicos
  - single bid
  - competition
  - CPV
  - Portugal
  - TED
  - European Union
